  m_text: "More options: \L\nNow let\u2019s put a face to your name!\nYou can keep
    the avatar we picked for you, create your own, or try a random one just for fun.\n\nTime
    to choose your look!\n\nStick with the one we chose, make your own, or shuffle
    through a few random ones, it\u2019s up to you.\n\nOr if we include the person's
    name:\nMaria, how about putting a face to your name?\n\nMaria, curious to see
    yourself in a new way?\nMaria, would you like to choose how you look in the app?"
